<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT  - Mobilemedia cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT  - Mobilemedia cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- JP Morgan analyst Kurt Abkemeier said he cut his rating on MobileMedia Corp to market perform from buy on the back of the company's announcement that it will not make its scheduled interest payment to its public debt holders.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 1/16 at two.</p>
</text>
